WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-01 - Our Own Frequency
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Our Own Frequency (2008)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.452
[Instrumental Intro — Warm Acoustic Guitar & Piano Duet]

00:00:17.452 --> 00:00:22.800
They want to paint us in neon light

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:27.800
They want to tell us how to burn tonight

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.500
But you and me, we know the truth

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.500
They can't buy what we built in our youth

00:00:35.597 --> 00:00:40.500
Turn off the synths, unplug the drum

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:45.909
Look at the monsters that we have become

00:00:46.089 --> 00:00:50.200
Let's strip it down to the wood and wire

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.500
And build ourselves a signal fire

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:56.861
Just the piano and the six-string strum

00:00:56.861 --> 00:01:02.000
Before the noise and the kingdom come

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.800
No one to tell us how the story ends

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:11.500
Just a brother and a sister and the time we spend

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:14.200
On our own frequency

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:17.000
Just you and me

00:01:25.303 --> 00:01:30.548
They tried to sell a manufactured dream

00:01:30.628 --> 00:01:35.500
A perfect picture on a glowing screen

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:38.500
But all I need is sitting right here

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:41.500
The melody is finally clear

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:46.965
Just the piano and the six-string strum

00:01:47.025 --> 00:01:52.200
Before the noise and the kingdom come

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:57.000
No one to tell us how the story ends

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:02.000
Just a brother and a sister and the time we spend

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.500
On our own frequency

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:06.500
Just you and me

00:02:08.671 --> 00:02:11.800
No heavy gloss...

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:15.115
No studio boss...

00:02:17.929 --> 00:02:26.000
Just the music we wanted to make!

00:02:26.956 --> 00:02:32.020
Just the piano and the six-string strum

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:37.558
Before the noise and the kingdom come

00:02:37.618 --> 00:02:42.420
No one to tell us how the story ends

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:47.000
Just a brother and a sister and the time we spend

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.800
On our own frequency

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:51.500
Just you and me

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:57.383
Our own frequency...

00:03:00.164 --> 00:03:03.000
Just you and me...

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:24.000
[Outro — Lingering Piano Chord & Soft Acoustic Strum]
